msgid "The equipped weapon gains 25% fire rate."
msgstr "装备的武器攻速提高 25%。"
msgid "The equipped weapon's projectile size is increased by 100%. Laser beam visual and collision width become 10 times the original width."
msgstr "装备武器的子弹体积提高 100%；激光光束的视觉与碰撞宽度变为原来的 10 倍。"
msgid "The equipped weapon's projectile size is increased by 200%. Laser beam visual and collision width become 10 times the original width."
msgstr "装备武器的子弹体积提高 200%；激光光束的视觉与碰撞宽度变为原来的 10 倍。"
msgid "Each enemy defeated by the equipped turret doubles the damage of its next attack. Each kill stores one charge."
msgstr "装备该道具的炮台每击败一个敌人，储存一次强化机会，使下一次攻击的伤害翻倍。"
msgid "When this Regeneration module heals the ship, enemies within its healing radius take damage equal to the hull HP actually restored."
msgstr "装备此道具的恢复模块为飞船回血时，治疗范围内的敌人受到与飞船实际恢复生命值等量的伤害。"
msgid "Tree Planet mining salvage chest"
msgstr "树木星球采矿宝箱"
msgid "The equipped weapon gains 25 targeting range."
msgstr "装备的武器获得 25 点射程。"
msgid "Projectile hits slow enemies by 30% and bosses by 15% for 2 seconds."
msgstr "子弹命中使普通敌人减速 30%，Boss 减速 15%，持续 2 秒。"
msgid "Each enemy defeated by the equipped turret releases a spirit that immediately damages nearby enemies for 33% of the defeated enemy's maximum health."
msgstr "装备该道具的炮台每击败一名敌人，都会在原地释放死灵，立刻对周围敌人造成被击败者最大生命值 33% 的伤害。"
msgid "The equipped turret gains 100% targeting range, but deals 25% less damage."
msgstr "装备该道具的炮台射程提高 100%，但造成的伤害降低 25%。"
msgid "The equipped turret deals 10% more damage."
msgstr "装备该道具的炮台伤害提高 10%。"
msgid "The equipped turret gains 1 base damage before Laboratory research bonuses."
msgstr "装备该道具的炮台基础伤害增加 1 点，并享受实验室研究加成。"
msgid "The equipped turret freezes its locked target, preventing movement and attacks. Only one target can be frozen at a time. Bosses are immune."
msgstr "装备该道具的炮台会冻结当前锁定目标，使其无法移动或攻击；同一时间只能冻结一个目标。Boss 免疫。"
msgid "Defeat Giant Frank on Graveyard Planet"
msgstr "在墓园星球击败巨人弗兰克"
msgid "Giant Frank"
msgstr "巨人弗兰克"
msgid "Verdant Planet mining salvage chest"
msgstr "翠绿星球采矿宝箱"
msgid "Frozen Planet mining salvage chest"
msgstr "冰冻星球采矿宝箱"
msgid "Graveyard Planet mining salvage chest"
msgstr "墓园星球采矿宝箱"
msgid "Every third physical bullet attack from this turret launches an additional zombie arm projectile that deals 50 damage. Missed attacks still count."
msgstr "装备该道具的炮台每第 3 次发射实体子弹时，会额外射出一只造成 50 点伤害的僵尸臂。未命中的攻击也计数。"
msgid "Enemies within 200 px of the ship are slowed by 30% while they remain inside the aura."
msgstr "飞船周围 200 像素内的敌人持续减速 30%，离开范围后恢复。"
msgid "The equipped turret slows its currently locked target's movement by 50%. Only the first locked target is affected at a time."
msgstr "装备该道具的炮台使当前锁定目标移速降低 50%；同一时间只影响一个目标。"
msgid "Rocky Planet mining salvage chest"
msgstr "岩石星球采矿宝箱"
msgid "Defeat Mega Monster on Frozen Planet"
msgstr "在冰冻星球击败巨型雪怪"
msgid "Increases the equipped Dwarf Cannon explosion or Knockback shockwave damage by 50%."
msgstr "装备的矮人加农炮爆炸伤害或击退模块冲击波伤害提高 50%。"
msgid "The equipped weapon gains 1% fire rate for every 2000 actual damage and healing it deals during this battle. Resets after battle."
msgstr "本局中，装备的武器每造成 2000 点实际伤害或治疗，其攻速提高 1%。战斗结束后重置。"
msgid "Every third direct projectile hit deals 50% of its actual damage to other enemies within 30 px of the target. Compatible with Machine Gun and Dwarf Cannon."
msgstr "每第 3 次子弹直接命中，对目标周围 30 像素内的其他敌人造成该次实际伤害 50% 的范围伤害。适用于机枪和矮人加农炮。"
msgid "A living core of ancient stone. It forms 30 Rock Armor, releases a damaging shockwave when shattered, and reforms after 30 seconds."
msgstr "古老岩石中蕴含生命的核心。提供 30 点岩石护甲，破碎时释放伤害冲击波，并在 30 秒后重新形成。"
msgid "Mining salvage chest"
msgstr "采矿宝箱"
msgid "Rock Titan"
msgstr "岩石泰坦"
msgid "Rocky Planet red crystal"
msgstr "岩石星球红水晶"
msgid "Goblin Giant Chariot"
msgstr "哥布林巨型战车"
msgid "Demon Lord"
msgstr "恶魔领主"
msgid "GOT IT"
msgstr "明白了"
msgid "SKIP"
msgstr "跳过"
msgid "OPEN THE HANGAR"
msgstr "打开机库"
msgid "Click your ship on the landing pad to start building it."
msgstr "点击停机坪上的飞船，开始进行装配。"
msgid "INSTALL A WEAPON"
msgstr "安装武器"
msgid "Weapons fire at enemies that approach the ship. Drag the MACHINE GUN onto an empty slot, or select a slot and press +."
msgstr "武器会攻击靠近飞船的敌人。将机枪拖到空槽位，或选择槽位后点击 +。"
msgid "INSTALL A MINING MODULE"
msgstr "安装采矿模块"
msgid "Mining modules drill ore during expeditions. Ore pays for research, chips and locating new planets. Scroll down the module list and drag MINING onto an empty slot."
msgstr "采矿模块在远征时开采矿石，矿石可用于研究、芯片和定位新星球。向下滑动模块列表，将采矿模块拖到空槽位。"
msgid "Every module uses Power (the bolt number on its card); the bar shows used / total. Your Energy Module gives 4. Research ENERGY in the Laboratory for more Power and more turrets."
msgstr "模块消耗电力（卡片闪电旁的数字）；电力条显示已用量和总量。能源模块提供 4 点电力。在实验室研究能源，可获得更多电力并安装更多武器。"
msgid "READY FOR LAUNCH"
msgstr "准备出发"
msgid "Go back to the base (ESC) and open the STAR MAP to choose a planet. Protect the ship, mine ore, then evacuate to bank it."
msgstr "返回基地（ESC），打开星图选择星球。保护飞船、开采矿石，然后撤离以保存收获。"
msgid "↓  MAGIC STALL AWAKENED"
msgstr "↓  魔法摊位已苏醒"
msgid "A mysterious power has awakened the Magic Stall in the base. Visit it to see your first artifact."
msgstr "一股神秘力量唤醒了基地中的魔法摊位。前往查看你的第一件魔法道具吧。"
msgid "OPEN MAGIC STALL"
msgstr "打开魔法摊位"
