msgstr "金币探测器"
msgid "Reach Dragon Nest Planet."
msgstr "可前往龙巢星球。"
msgid "The ship can now reach Dragon Nest Planet."
msgstr "飞船现在可以前往龙巢星球。"
msgid "Magic Item Slot II"
msgstr "魔法道具槽 II"
msgid "Unlock the second ship magic item slot."
msgstr "解锁飞船的第二个魔法道具槽。"
msgid "Permanently increases maximum ship HP by 20. Requires Gold Detector and Magic Item Slot II."
msgstr "永久增加飞船生命值上限 20 点，需要金币探测器和第二个魔法道具槽。"
msgid "Permanently increases maximum ship HP by 20 after both branches are completed."
msgstr "完成两条前置分支后，永久增加飞船生命值上限 20 点。"
msgid "Reach Graveyard Planet."
msgstr "可前往墓园星球。"
msgid "The ship can now reach Graveyard Planet."
msgstr "飞船现在可以前往墓园星球。"
msgid "Ship Expansion Slot I"
msgstr "飞船扩展槽 I"
msgid "Ship Expansion Slot II"
msgstr "飞船扩展槽 II"
msgid "After clearing Verdant Planet, unlock one additional ship module slot in the Hangar."
msgstr "通关翠绿星球后，在机库解锁一个额外飞船模块槽。"
msgid "After clearing Graveyard Planet, unlock a second additional ship module slot."
msgstr "通关墓园星球后，再解锁一个额外飞船模块槽。"
msgid "Ship Rotation"
msgstr "飞船旋转"
msgid "Rotate the ship layout in the Hangar."
msgstr "在机库旋转飞船布局。"
msgid "Research Ship Rotation in the Laboratory (Ship)"
msgstr "在实验室的飞船研究中解锁飞船旋转。"
msgid "Built-in Power Cell II"
msgstr "飞船内置电池 II"
msgid "The ship itself supplies one more Power, without an Energy Module."
msgstr "飞船自身再提供 1 点电力，无需能源模块。"
msgid "SHIP EXPANSION"
msgstr "扩展飞船"
msgid "Expanded slots: %d / %d"
msgstr "已扩展格位：%d / %d"
msgid "CHOOSE A SLOT"
msgstr "选择格位"
msgid "CANCEL EXPANSION"
msgstr "取消扩展"
msgid "ALL SLOTS PLACED"
msgstr "格位已全部放置"
msgid "SKIP GUIDE"
msgstr "跳过引导"
msgid "NEW: Choose a dashed cell around the ship to add a module slot. The four corners cannot be expanded."
msgstr "新功能：点击飞船周围的虚线格，可增加模块槽位；四个角不能扩展。"
